    "modalityAccuracy": "Exact status agreement on aligned events; missing events separately affect recall.",
    "references": "Only relationship references, local to each raw event. Country attribution refs are not included for cross-version comparability.",
    "scope": "Thirty hand-labelled fictional short publications. Same model, two prompt/schema contracts. No confidence-based scoring, no statistical significance claim. Deterministic saved-response tests are reported separately."
